From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] gamefixes-steam: Gears of War: E-Day: hide Wine from GameInput

The bundled GameInputRedist.dll switches to an XInput-only backend when it
detects Wine, so the DualSense has no identity or haptic info through
GameInput. WINE_GAMEINPUT_HIDE_WINE hides the Wine exports from that module
only (GE-Proton kernelbase patch); the rest of the process still sees Wine.
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/protonfixes/gamefixes-steam/3010850.py
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+"""Game fix for Gears of War: E-Day"""
+
+from protonfixes import util
+
+
+def main() -> None:
+    # The bundled GameInput redistributable uses a reduced XInput-only backend
+    # when it detects Wine, which loses native DualSense support. Hide the
+    # Wine exports from GameInputRedist.dll only.
+    util.set_environment('WINE_GAMEINPUT_HIDE_WINE', '1')
